---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// Entries are stored by a Google Apps Script web app on insyncnyc@gmail.com
// (source: planning/giveaway/Code.gs). Paste its /exec URL here to turn the form on;
// while empty, the page falls back to email-only entries.
const GIVEAWAY_ENDPOINT = 'https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbySv64YYHUTW0IE3EUvEIVeUiXNcv6durp7xwuyJiGmDtGHxLnkYbl6V2T5TL0-my4Elg/exec';
const FORM_ENABLED = GIVEAWAY_ENDPOINT !== '';

const mailSubject = 'Book giveaway entry';
const mailBody = `Name:\nBook (title and author):\nInstagram handle (optional):\nOK to share my note (with my first name) on the IN SYNC site and Instagram? Yes / No\n\n(Attach a photo of your handwritten note with the book.)\n`;
const mailto = `mailto:insyncnyc@gmail.com?subject=${encodeURIComponent(mailSubject)}&body=${encodeURIComponent(mailBody)}`;
---

<BaseLayout title="End-of-Year Book Giveaway" description="Write a staff-pick note on a book you love for a chance to win Min Jin Lee's American Hagwon.">

  <div class="gw-header">
    <div class="gw-header-inner">
      <p class="gw-eyebrow">Book Giveaway · Entries close Dec 13</p>
      <h1 class="gw-heading">Our End-of-Year Book Giveaway</h1>
      <p class="gw-subheading">Share a book you love, in your own words.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="gw-body">
    <div class="gw-inner">

      <div class="gw-copy">
        <p>Writing is often something we do alone, but you can share part of your creative journey with the community. One day we'll get to the point of sharing drafts and building on each other's feedback. For now, let's start with something simple (and less scary): share a book you love, in your own words.</p>
        <p>Think of the handwritten staff picks you see in a bookshop: a few sentences, tucked next to the book, on why someone loved it. Just like that.</p>
      </div>

      <figure class="gw-example">
        <img src="/assets/giveaway-example-note.jpg" alt="A handwritten pink note propped next to Everything I Never Told You by Celeste Ng: 'A family spent much time together but didn't talk about many things. Immigrant parents drew life maps for their beloved children, only to find out later that their destinations were somewhere else. A captivating page turner, which my friend correctly warned: NOT a beach read. Unless you like to mix tears with piña colada.'" />
        <figcaption>My note on Celeste Ng's <em>Everything I Never Told You</em>.</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="gw-prize">
        <img src="/assets/book-american-hagwon.jpg" alt="American Hagwon by Min Jin Lee" class="gw-cover" />
        <div class="gw-copy">
          <p>And let's make it fun. Write your note by hand, take a picture of it with the book, and submit it below. You'll be entered in a drawing for a copy of <strong><em>American Hagwon</em></strong>, the new novel by Min Jin Lee, the National Book Award finalist author of <em>Pachinko</em>, who grew up in Queens(!). You've probably heard about it already, but if not, <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UW2Jt27B5H4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="gw-link">this quick book chat</a> will give you a sense of what it's about.</p>
          <p><strong>Good to know:</strong> entries are due by <strong>Sunday, December 13</strong>. We'll draw a name on Monday, December 14, and reach out to the winner to set up a handoff in Queens. It could be your holiday read!</p>
          <p>If you check the box to let us share, we'll post your note on our <a href="/reading" class="gw-link">What We're Reading</a> page and on Instagram as entries come in, so you'll get to see what everyone else loved reading.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gw-divider"></div>

      <div id="gw-open">
        <h2 class="gw-section-title">Share your book</h2>
        {!FORM_ENABLED && (
          <div class="gw-email">
            <p class="gw-p">Email a photo of your handwritten note with the book to <a href={mailto} class="gw-link">insyncnyc@gmail.com</a>, along with your name and the book's title.</p>
            <a href={mailto} class="gw-submit gw-submit--link">Email your entry</a>
          </div>
        )}
        {FORM_ENABLED && (<>
        <form name="book-giveaway" data-endpoint={GIVEAWAY_ENDPOINT} class="gw-form" novalidate>
          <p class="gw-hidden"><label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>

          <div class="gw-row">
            <label class="gw-field">
              <span class="gw-label">Your name</span>
              <input type="text" name="name" required />
            </label>
            <label class="gw-field">
              <span class="gw-label">Email</span>
              <input type="email" name="email" required />
            </label>
          </div>

          <label class="gw-field">
            <span class="gw-label">The book (title and author)</span>
            <input type="text" name="book" required />
          </label>

          <label class="gw-field">
            <span class="gw-label">Photo of your note with the book</span>
            <input type="file" name="photo" accept="image/*" required />
          </label>

          <label class="gw-field">
            <span class="gw-label">Instagram handle <span class="gw-hint">(optional, so we can tag you)</span></span>
            <input type="text" name="instagram" placeholder="@" />
          </label>

          <label class="gw-check">
            <input type="checkbox" name="ok-to-share" value="yes" checked />
            <span>It's OK to share my note (with my first name) on the IN SYNC site and Instagram.</span>
          </label>

          <p class="gw-error" id="gw-error" hidden></p>

          <button type="submit" class="gw-submit" id="gw-submit">Enter the giveaway</button>
        </form>

        <p class="gw-alt">Prefer email? Send your photo to <a href={mailto} class="gw-link">insyncnyc@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        </>)}
      </div>

      <div id="gw-closed" hidden>
        <h2 class="gw-section-title">Entries are closed</h2>
        <p class="gw-p">Thank you to everyone who shared a book. See what the community recommended on our <a href="/reading" class="gw-link">What We're Reading</a> page.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gw-divider"></div>

      <div class="gw-rules">
        <h2 class="gw-rules-title">The fine print</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>One entry per person. Entries close Sunday, December 13, 2026 at 11:59 PM ET.</li>
          <li>One winner is drawn at random on Monday, December 14 and contacted by email to set up a handoff in Queens.</li>
          <li>Free to enter. No purchase or event attendance needed.</li>
          <li>Rather keep your note private? {FORM_ENABLED ? 'Just uncheck the box above.' : 'Just say so in your email.'}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<script>
  // Entries close Sun Dec 13, 2026, 11:59 PM ET.
  const closesAt = new Date('2026-12-13T23:59:59-05:00');
  if (new Date() > closesAt) {
    document.getElementById('gw-open')?.setAttribute('hidden', '');
    document.getElementById('gw-closed')?.removeAttribute('hidden');
  }

  const form = document.querySelector('form[name="book-giveaway"]') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const err = document.getElementById('gw-error');
  const submitBtn = document.getElementById('gw-submit') as HTMLButtonElement | null;
  const showError = (msg: string) => { if (err) { err.textContent = msg; err.hidden = false; } };

  // Shrink phone photos before upload so they send quickly and reliably.
  const resizePhoto = (file: File): Promise<{ data: string; mimeType: string }> =>
    new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
      const img = new Image();
      img.onload = () => {
        const max = 1600;
        const scale = Math.min(1, max / Math.max(img.width, img.height));
        const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');
        canvas.width = Math.round(img.width * scale);
        canvas.height = Math.round(img.height * scale);
        canvas.getContext('2d')!.drawImage(img, 0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
        URL.revokeObjectURL(img.src);
        resolve({ data: canvas.toDataURL('image/jpeg', 0.85).split(',')[1], mimeType: 'image/jpeg' });
      };
      img.onerror = () => reject(new Error('photo'));
      img.src = URL.createObjectURL(file);
    });

  form?.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    if (err) err.hidden = true;
    const fd = new FormData(form);
    const photoFile = (form.querySelector('input[name="photo"]') as HTMLInputElement).files?.[0];

    if (!String(fd.get('name') || '').trim() || !String(fd.get('book') || '').trim()) {
      return showError('Please add your name and the book.');
    }
    const email = String(fd.get('email') || '').trim();
    if (!/^[^@\s]+@[^@\s]+\.[^@\s]+$/.test(email)) return showError('Please add a valid email so we can reach you if you win.');
    if (!photoFile) return showError('Please add a photo of your handwritten note with the book.');

    if (submitBtn) { submitBtn.disabled = true; submitBtn.textContent = 'Sending…'; }
    try {
      const payload = {
        name: fd.get('name'),
        email,
        book: fd.get('book'),
        instagram: fd.get('instagram'),
        okToShare: fd.get('ok-to-share') === 'yes',
        botField: fd.get('bot-field'),
        photo: await resizePhoto(photoFile),
      };
      // text/plain avoids a CORS preflight, which Apps Script doesn't answer.
      const res = await fetch(form.dataset.endpoint!, {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'text/plain;charset=utf-8' },
        body: JSON.stringify(payload),
      });
      const out = await res.json();
      if (!out.ok) throw new Error(out.error === 'closed' ? 'closed' : 'server');
      window.location.href = '/giveaway/thanks';
    } catch (ex) {
      if (submitBtn) { submitBtn.disabled = false; submitBtn.textContent = 'Enter the giveaway'; }
      const m = (ex as Error).message;
      showError(m === 'closed' ? 'Sorry, entries have closed.'
        : m === 'photo' ? "We couldn't read that photo. Please try a JPG or PNG, or email it to insyncnyc@gmail.com."
        : 'Something went wrong sending your entry. Please try again, or email it to insyncnyc@gmail.com.');
    }
  });
</script>

<style>
  .gw-header {
    background: var(--color-dark);
    padding: 80px 48px 56px;
  }
  .gw-header-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .gw-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-coral);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .gw-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-cream);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .gw-subheading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(250,246,241,0.88);
  }

  .gw-body {
    background: var(--color-cream);
    padding: 64px 48px 96px;
  }
  .gw-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .gw-prize {
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .gw-example {
    margin: 12px auto 48px;
    max-width: 420px;
  }
  .gw-example img {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(42,14,24,0.15);
  }
  .gw-example figcaption {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
  .gw-copy + .gw-example { margin-top: 8px; }
  .gw-cover {
    width: 200px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(42,14,24,0.18);
  }
  .gw-copy p,
  .gw-p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .gw-copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .gw-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    margin: 56px 0;
  }

  .gw-section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-coral);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .gw-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; }
  .gw-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; }
  .gw-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .gw-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }
  .gw-hint {
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .gw-field input[type="text"],
  .gw-field input[type="email"],
  .gw-field textarea {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(42,14,24,0.18);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 0;
  }
  .gw-field input:focus,
  .gw-field textarea:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-coral);
    outline-offset: -1px;
  }
  .gw-field input[type="file"] {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .gw-check {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .gw-check input { margin-top: 5px; accent-color: var(--color-coral); }

  .gw-error {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #b3261e;
  }

  .gw-submit {
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: var(--color-coral);
    color: var(--color-cream);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border: none;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .gw-submit:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  .gw-submit:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: wait; }
  .gw-submit--link { display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 8px; }
  .gw-submit--link:hover { text-decoration: none; }

  .gw-alt {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .gw-link {
    color: var(--color-coral);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .gw-link:hover { opacity: 0.8; }

  .gw-rules-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .gw-rules ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .gw-hidden { display: none; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .gw-header { padding: 48px 20px 40px; }
    .gw-heading { font-size: 36px; }
    .gw-body { padding: 40px 20px 72px; }
    .gw-prize { flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; }
    .gw-example { max-width: 100%; }
    .gw-cover { width: 160px; }
    .gw-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
